Z||000006||87ECO5||09-01-2000||10:49 AM||||Randy mentions that the front bar should be upgraded to 1".  What implications can be expected if this is not done?||||reg||5
Z||000007||lawrence||09-01-2000||09:56 PM||||Adding a rear bar increases oversteer, so my guess is that he's suggesting a larger front bar to add understeer, thus keeping it neutral.<P>-L<BR> <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe</A>  - WebElectric Magazine||||reg||1
